# Unleash (CR 702.98a): "can't block as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it" counts any +1/+1 counter, not only the one
# unleash gives (its ruling). Bot1 casts Dead Reveler and declines the counter, then puts one on it with Snakeskin Veil.
# On turn 2 it can't block Bot2's hasty Mountain Bandit, so Bot1 takes 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Snakeskin Veil
Dead Reveler
Island
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mountain Bandit
Island x20

